  "name": "Kinetic_Lance",
  "full_name": "Guardian_Assault.Kinetic_Assault.Kinetic_Lance",
  "short_name": "Kinetic_Lance",
  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Kinetic Lance",
  "display_fullname": "Guardian Assault Kinetic Assault Kinetic Lance",
  "display_help": "You form the potential energies around you into a lance of energy that you fire at a single target. This lance pierces the target, causing an initial burst of extreme energy and lethal damage that then causes a minor amount of damage over time.  Affected foes will also have their movement speed and recharge rate reduced for a short time.  Kinetic Lance awards 3 stacks of Impulse if the interruptible version is used, if instant-cast this power will award 2 stacks of Impulse.  This is a sniper attack, and is best fired from a distance, as it can be interrupted. If you have more than 97% To-Hit, this attack becomes instant-cast.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Slow",
  "display_short_help": "Sniper, Extreme DMG (Energy/Lethal), Foe Minor DoT (Lethal), -Speed, -Recharge, Self +Impulse",
